  "description": "Automatic FluentValidation for Hlibz.MinimalApi.Endpoints: options.AddFluentValidation() attaches a validation filter to every endpoint whose handler takes a parameter with an IValidator<T> registered, and documents its 400. Nothing to opt into per endpoint. The failure is a validation problem by default, or whatever result your API returns (e.g. Hlibz.Results' result.ToErrorResult().ToHttpResult()). Validators resolve per request, so any lifetime works. Works with FluentValidation 11.0.0 and later.",
